>>>

<<<
polypus. Pl. -pi (-i) or -puses. The

inconsistency between this & octopus

is due to its having come to us

through classical Latin, in which it

was declined like the ordinary Latin

nouns in -us.
===
**polypus.** Pl. *-pi* (-ī) or *-puses*. The inconsistency between this & *octopus* is due to its having come to us through classical Latin, in which it was declined like the ordinary Latin nouns in -*us*.
>>>

<<<
