DANTIC HUMOUR for a slight account

of the impulse that suggests long or

abstruse words as a means of entertaining the hearer.
===
**POLYSYLLABIC HUMOUR.** See ^^PEDANTIC HUMOUR^^ for a slight account of the impulse that suggests long or abstruse words as a means of entertaining the hearer.
>>>

