<<<
POMPOSITIES. Such words as

beverage, catarrh, collation, comesti-

bles, condiment, co’nsort, divagation,

edifice, emporium, ere, evince, exacer-

bate, intermediary, the military, munificent, save (except), spouse, vituper-

ate, have all ‘a certain use in the

world, no doubt’;
===
**POMPOSITIES.** Such words as *beverage, catarrh, collation, comestibles, condiment, co'nsort, divagation, edifice, emporium, ere, evince, exacerbate, intermediary, the military, munificent, save* (except), *spouse, vituperate,* have all 'a certain use in the world, no doubt';
>>>

