<<<
poor. The unorthodox pronunciations por & por are heard often enough to necessitate a warning, For poorness & poverty see the latter. For ‘a p. thing but mine own ’, see MISQUOTATION,
===
**poor.** The unorthodox pronunciations pōr & por are heard often enough to necessitate a warning. For *poorness* & *poverty* see the latter. For 'a p. thing but mine own', see ^^MISQUOTATION^^.
>>>

