which became familiar through a conspicuous use of it during the war by President Wilson. In contrast with this newest acquisition may be set *intoxicated,* so long popular as to be not now recognizable for a medical term at all; it is just a ponderous ^^GENTEELISM^^ for *drunk.*
>>>

